# The veepin image is built with the netgraph repository root as its context
# (see vpn/Dockerfile). BuildKit reads this file in place of the root
# .dockerignore because it sits beside the Dockerfile. It is an allow-list:
# the build needs the module files and vpn/, and nothing else.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!vpn
vpn/nm/bin
vpn/tests/interop/**/bin
vpn/tests/e2e/node_modules
**/*.deb
**/*.rpm
**/*.apk
